  "content": "\n\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oCymEzz.png\" alt=\"標題\"/></h1>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=DISCORD&color=%235865F2\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/one-tap-phantoms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1300516?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/one-tap-phantoms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/one-tap-phantoms?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></p></center>\n<center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">此模組允許您設定幽靈的血量。在原版 Minecraft 中，幽靈擁有 20 點血量——與玩家相同——我認為對於這種煩人的怪物來說實在太耐打了。此模組預設將它們的血量降至僅 1 點，讓您可以一拳擊殺。但如果您願意，也可以將它們的血量更改為任意數值。例如，將血量設為 10 時，只有附魔鋒利 V 的鑽石劍才能一刀將其擊殺。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4AKXnNo.gif\" /></p>\n</center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>設定</strong></summary>\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接設定此模組，或是編輯個人檔案資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/onetapphantoms.json</code>。</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>phantom_hp</b> - 幽靈預設生成時的血量</p></center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
